# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# IMPORTANT: do NOT add a blanket `/*  /index.html  200` SPA catch-all here.
# This site prerenders its public/SEO pages to real static HTML
# (/, /homeschool-laws, /homeschool-laws/<state>, /guides, /guides/<slug>).
# A blanket catch-all shadows the clean (extension-less) URLs of those files:
# Cloudflare serves the prerendered page only at the explicit `.html` path and
# rewrites every clean URL to the homepage shell — which is exactly the bug
# Googlebot saw (canonical="/", no page content) even though the .html exists.
#
# Only the client-only, localStorage-backed app routes below have no
# prerendered HTML and therefore need the SPA shell as a deep-link fallback.
# Everything else is served as its prerendered static file at its clean URL.
/dashboard    /index.html  200
/compliance   /index.html  200
/transcript   /index.html  200
/child/*      /index.html  200
